<description>&lt;p&gt;ISWAP commanders were killed by the Nigerian army in Borno while the group also killed a Nigerian soldier in a separate attack. Mali announced an ex-colonel as president and JNIM claimed an IED attack on a Malian army and Africa Corps vehicle between Sévaré and Konna. Russian Su-24M2 strike fighters provided close air support in Central Africa, and Algeria is attempting to bolster its posture in the Sahel. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0HSAWNBVV95cUxPc3BzWlV6ZXZyZkNSbzAwSzRGTmtiNkRsUEtKVWhxNXhkaUZkRThMa2owUVU4eGVOMnNqamY1TFBaTWNCSUYxTzF0ZG1Tb1I2bFNOb01DMTByczVoMG13MFdhUDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5oT2RKWWJoT2VJVi0xcnlZWXFiMVZtUXVFUmF1VHBXTVZVRGtnQmplWU00XzZVZHJVRmVubWRGY3NEOFlZVnNCVTM5cTczc05CX21QUlg2OHRBY1p1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5aUC1IMVJzbzF6YWdhTmlYTnNZeFFXR3hXR3V2LXlFS0tBUUZlQ2pScDBFTFp3T0F4Q0JqXzBBVzZRZUtkUk15UlNVWVh5WTg0UjZQSm9PSjg1NzhYUTZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gistmania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPOFoxZ0ZPb1Q4bXd0R04xTUVweVZTcm4tNGFDa1RCaEtfNEZ6WmxYNW96WVNmUUQxZDFUM0loWG0yY1QtTW5aN2gySVlpRjV2Vk85YzhfYk5Scm9iY1F1RDMyM2NfV25YczlWcWNPSXBjN0xJLXZDUjg1dEJ2bDBTVXBpcnlfU3RTZk9qRXdyQi1wWEJlell1RWVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBkNlJTaWJ0dWNqQmtjNlRmaGNzZkJab1JneXIway14NlNIMDVMTHNKUHliVHo3SlFJckxROVBpbVFrUGRLZEVQQmRzVGE2ZHVqRlF3eXM5SmhhQ045MjFsak9peGhMTEV1Zkhv?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&q